1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
How to use the print on the pattern?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
It is very difficult for the client to understand the final effect of the print on the pattern.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Previously, we used to sell the print in silver or make the existing pattern online,

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
and then fill in the effect to show it to the client.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
In this case, it is both time-consuming and labor-intensive, and it is not intuitive.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
It is difficult to determine the final size.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Now, we can show it to the client directly and efficiently.

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Like this, this is the final effect of the print on the pattern we want to show to the client.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,000
This way, it is more intuitive and can directly know the final size.

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
I am a designer from Kaixin.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
My daily work is to design and develop with the client's needs.

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,000
As a designer,

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
the most painful thing in my previous work is to communicate with the client.

14
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
The client's understanding of the pattern is often biased,

15
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
and it is difficult to convert the designer's feeling in the communication.

16
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
It is often necessary to wait for the sample to be made and then communicate and modify it face-to-face.

17
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Now that we have 3D, the whole process becomes very simple.

18
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
With 70% of the design, we can directly confirm it through 3D,

19
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
make a precise sample, and quickly recommend it to the client.

20
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000
We can even do a quick version for some clients.

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Or we can use 3D to make a 3D design

22
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,000
that can be directly confirmed by 3D and the client designer.

23
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:32,000
I believe that in the future, 3D will help us to work more simply and easily.

24
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,000
I am a designer from Kaixin.

25
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
I am mainly responsible for 3D production in France.

26
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,000
I used to need a week to make a sample,

27
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,000
but now I can make a 3D in one or two hours.

28
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,000
I can send it directly to them to confirm.

29
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
It is more convenient to modify,

30
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
and there is no need to waste so much manpower and physical strength.

31
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Now that there are more 3D designs,

32
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,000
I can modify some of the designs myself.

33
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:03,000
The high-effectiveness of different materials is interesting to me.

34
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,000
I have a better understanding of some of the techniques.

35
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:10,000
I am mainly responsible for the work of a French office designer.

36
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Due to the difference in language, professional knowledge,

37
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:16,000
geographical and cultural, and different ways of thinking,

38
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:19,000
communication has always been a big problem.

39
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,000
After using the 3D system,

40
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
the confirmation becomes very intuitive.

41
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
The technical problems are very easy to communicate with.

42
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Moreover, I am very happy that the initial phase of the 3D design

43
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,000
has been converted into a 3D template.

44
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,000
The designer is very happy.

45
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:35,000
At the same time, the cost of developing the relevant fabric and sewing is significantly reduced.

46
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,000
The cycle of developing a style has also been shortened to several days.

